=2 Walkthrough
* Enter the {z:Outer Horutoto Ruins} from {z:West Sarutabaruta} (F-11).
* Kill Cardians in the area to get one (or more) of the following {p:Key Items|Key Item}:
** {@k} {k:Orb of Swords}
** {@k} {k:Orb of Cups}
** {@k} {k:Orb of Batons}
** {@k} {k:Orb of Coins}
* After receiving the Orbs you want, zone into {z:Outer Horutoto Ruins} from {z:East Sarutabaruta} (H-3).
* Examine the **???** on top of the platform at (H-6) (it'll be right in front of you when you enter the zone) to begin a battlefield.
** {p:Trust Magic} can not be used in this battlefield.
** Up to 15 {m:Custom Cardians|Custom Cardian} will spawn and begin to attack.
** The player starting the battle will lose all of their possessed Orbs.
** The number and types of Orb key items in the possession of the player starting the battle will affect the number of Custom Cardians that spawn and damage type immunity:
*** {@k} Orb of Swords removes slashing damage immunity.
*** {@k} Orb of Batons removes blunt damage immunity
*** {@k} Orb of Cups removes piercing damage immunity.
*** {@k} Orb of Coins removes magic damage immunity.
*** With 1 or 2 Orbs, 15 Cardians will appear.
*** With 3 Orbs, 10 Cardians will appear.
*** With all 4 Orbs, 5 Cardians will appear.
** Anyone else in the party with different Orbs, will lose them and not have their bonus granted.
*** You receive 500 experience points, a {@k} {p:Ripe starfruit|Ripe starfruit (Kupo)}, and a {@k} {k:Peach coral key} upon winning.
* Return to {p:Shantotto}. She will require you give her 5000 gil.
* Return to the Inconspicuous Door in {z:Upper Jeuno} (H-8) (across from Durable Shields) for a cutscene.

=2 "A Moogle Kupo d'Etat" Key
* Use the {@k} {k:Peach coral key} (Level 50) to open the red treasure coffer at {z:Lower Jeuno} (J-8).
** Rewards are listed on the {p:Add-on Scenario Rewards} page.
* Repeat the mission to obtain another {@k} {k:Peach coral key}.
** Alternatively, the set of 4 Mana Orbs ({@k} {k:Orb of Swords}, {@k} {k:Orb of Cups}, {@k} {k:Orb of Batons}, {@k} {k:Orb of Coins}) can be purchased from {n:Squintrox Dryeyes} for 500g and 5 {i:Beastmen's Seals|Beastmen's Seal|1126} after all Kupo Missions are completed.

